  "result": "I fixed the bug in `src/server/services/member-service.ts`. I haven't run the test suite or added a test for it.\n\n`removeMember` was calling `assertLastOwnerRetained(orgId, memberId, \"owner\")`. The helper returns immediately when the next role is `\"owner\"`, so the check never ran and the last owner could be removed. Demotion passed the real new role, so it was still refused.\n\n`assertLastOwnerRetained` now accepts `Role | null`, and `removeMember` passes `null` to mean \"no role after this change\". The last-owner check now applies to removals as well as demotions.\n\nThe `removeMemberAction` server action calls `removeMember`, so it picks up the fix. Nothing else in `src` calls `archiveMember`, so there is no other removal path that skips the check.",
